tokens.text:
Ability modifier
Derive the modifier from the ability score, rounding down.
Parameters: {"formula":"floor((ability_score - 10) / 2)"}

Модификатор характеристики
Модификатор вычисляется из значения характеристики с округлением вниз.
Параметры: {"formula":"floor((ability_score - 10) / 2)"}

Proficiency bonus
Add proficiency only where applicable; never add it repeatedly.
Parameters: {"hero_level_bands":[{"min":1,"max":4,"bonus":2},{"min":5,"max":8,"bonus":3},{"min":9,"max":12,"bonus":4},{"min":13,"max":16,"bonus":5},{"min":17,"max":20,"bonus":6}],"stacking":false,"multiply_at_most_once":true,"divide_at_most_once":true}

Бонус мастерства
Владение добавляется только когда применимо; повторно не складывается.
Параметры: {"hero_level_bands":[{"min":1,"max":4,"bonus":2},{"min":5,"max":8,"bonus":3},{"min":9,"max":12,"bonus":4},{"min":13,"max":16,"bonus":5},{"min":17,"max":20,"bonus":6}],"stacking":false,"multiply_at_most_once":true,"divide_at_most_once":true}

Ability check
Compare the total with difficulty; equality succeeds.
Parameters: {"roll":"1d20","add":["ability_modifier","applicable_proficiency","other_modifiers"],"success":"total >= dc","natural_1_auto_failure":false,"natural_20_auto_success":false}

Проверка характеристики
Результат сравнивается со сложностью; равенство означает успех.
Параметры: {"roll":"1d20","add":["ability_modifier","applicable_proficiency","other_modifiers"],"success":"total >= dc","natural_1_auto_failure":false,"natural_20_auto_success":false}

Saving throw
The effect determines the ability; use the creature proficiency.
Parameters: {"roll":"1d20","add":["specified_ability_modifier","save_proficiency_if_present","other_modifiers"],"success":"total >= dc","natural_1_auto_failure":false,"natural_20_auto_success":false,"exception":"death_saving_throws"}

Спасбросок
Характеристику определяет эффект; владение берётся из профиля существа.
Параметры: {"roll":"1d20","add":["specified_ability_modifier","save_proficiency_if_present","other_modifiers"],"success":"total >= dc","natural_1_auto_failure":false,"natural_20_auto_success":false,"exception":"death_saving_throws"}

Typical difficulties
Use the table to set difficulty for an uncertain attempt.
Parameters: {"dc":{"very_easy":5,"easy":10,"medium":15,"hard":20,"very_hard":25,"nearly_impossible":30}}

Типичные сложности
Таблица помогает назначить сложность неопределённой попытки.
Параметры: {"dc":{"very_easy":5,"easy":10,"medium":15,"hard":20,"very_hard":25,"nearly_impossible":30}}

Advantage and disadvantage
Like effects do not accumulate; opposing effects cancel.
Parameters: {"roll":"2d20","advantage":"take_higher","disadvantage":"take_lower","both_present":"roll_1d20","multiple_sources":"no_additional_dice","reroll_rule":"reroll_only_one_die_when_a_rule_allows_reroll"}

Преимущество и помеха
Одинаковые эффекты не накапливаются; противоположные взаимно отменяются.
Параметры: {"roll":"2d20","advantage":"take_higher","disadvantage":"take_lower","both_present":"roll_1d20","multiple_sources":"no_additional_dice","reroll_rule":"reroll_only_one_die_when_a_rule_allows_reroll"}

Passive check
A passive result replaces a roll where appropriate.
Parameters: {"base":10,"add":["usual_check_modifiers"],"advantage_bonus":5,"disadvantage_penalty":-5}

Пассивная проверка
Пассивный результат заменяет бросок, когда это уместно.
Параметры: {"base":10,"add":["usual_check_modifiers"],"advantage_bonus":5,"disadvantage_penalty":-5}

Contest
Compare participants totals; a tie preserves the existing situation.
Parameters: {"winner":"higher_total","tie":"status_quo"}

Состязание
Сравниваются результаты участников; ничья сохраняет исходную ситуацию.
Параметры: {"winner":"higher_total","tie":"status_quo"}

Group check
Group success depends on the share of successful participants.
Parameters: {"success":"successful_count >= ceil(participant_count / 2)","dm_decides_applicability":true}

Групповая проверка
Успех группы определяется долей успешных участников.
Параметры: {"success":"successful_count >= ceil(participant_count / 2)","dm_decides_applicability":true}

Working together
A capable helper grants advantage when collaboration is possible.
Parameters: {"effect":"advantage","helper_must_be_able_to_attempt":true,"task_must_benefit_from_help":true}

Совместная работа
Компетентный помощник даёт преимущество при совместимой задаче.
Параметры: {"effect":"advantage","helper_must_be_able_to_attempt":true,"task_must_benefit_from_help":true}

Initiative
Dexterity checks determine turn order.
Parameters: {"check":"dex","order":"descending","identical_monsters":"one_group_roll_allowed","tie":"players_order_tied_pcs; dm_orders_tied_monsters_or_pc_monster_tie"}

Инициатива
Порядок ходов определяется проверкой Ловкости.
Параметры: {"check":"dex","order":"descending","identical_monsters":"one_group_roll_allowed","tie":"players_order_tied_pcs; dm_orders_tied_monsters_or_pc_monster_tie"}

Surprise
Determine surprise separately for each participant.
Parameters: {"detection":"stealth_vs_passive_perception","surprised_when":"notices_no_threat","first_turn":{"movement":false,"action":false,"bonus_action":false},"reaction_available_after":"end_of_own_first_turn","extra_surprise_round":false}

Внезапность
Внезапность определяется для каждого участника отдельно.
Параметры: {"detection":"stealth_vs_passive_perception","surprised_when":"notices_no_threat","first_turn":{"movement":false,"action":false,"bonus_action":false},"reaction_available_after":"end_of_own_first_turn","extra_surprise_round":false}

Turn economy
Track movement separately; a bonus action requires a granting feature.
Parameters: {"action":1,"bonus_action_maximum":1,"bonus_action_requires_feature":true,"movement":"speed","free_object_interaction":1,"round_seconds":6}

Ресурсы хода
Перемещение и действия учитываются независимо; бонусное действие требует разрешения.
Параметры: {"action":1,"bonus_action_maximum":1,"bonus_action_requires_feature":true,"movement":"speed","free_object_interaction":1,"round_seconds":6}

Reaction
A spent reaction returns at the start of the next own turn.
Parameters: {"maximum_available":1,"reset":"start_of_own_turn","requires_trigger":true}

Реакция
Потраченная реакция восстанавливается в начале следующего собственного хода.
Параметры: {"maximum_available":1,"reset":"start_of_own_turn","requires_trigger":true}

Attack roll
An attack hits when its total reaches armor class.
Parameters: {"roll":"1d20","success":"total >= armor_class","natural_1":"miss","natural_20":"hit_and_critical","weapon_melee_default":"str","weapon_ranged_default":"dex","finesse":"choose_str_or_dex_for_attack_and_damage","thrown":"use_ability_for_melee_attack_with_weapon"}

Бросок атаки
Атака попадает при достижении класса доспеха.
Параметры: {"roll":"1d20","success":"total >= armor_class","natural_1":"miss","natural_20":"hit_and_critical","weapon_melee_default":"str","weapon_ranged_default":"dex","finesse":"choose_str_or_dex_for_attack_and_damage","thrown":"use_ability_for_melee_attack_with_weapon"}

Critical hit
Double attack damage dice, but not flat modifiers.
Parameters: {"damage_dice_multiplier":2,"flat_modifier_multiplier":1,"includes_additional_attack_damage_dice":true}

Критическое попадание
Удваиваются кости урона атаки, но не постоянные прибавки.
Параметры: {"damage_dice_multiplier":2,"flat_modifier_multiplier":1,"includes_additional_attack_damage_dice":true}

Ranged attack
Range and nearby hostiles can hinder a ranged attack.
Parameters: {"normal_range":"normal","between_normal_and_long":"disadvantage","beyond_long":"not_allowed","nearby_hostile":{"distance_ft":5,"must_see_attacker":true,"must_not_be_incapacitated":true,"effect":"disadvantage_on_any_ranged_attack"}}

Дальнобойная атака
Дальность и близкий противник могут ограничивать дальнобойную атаку.
Параметры: {"normal_range":"normal","between_normal_and_long":"disadvantage","beyond_long":"not_allowed","nearby_hostile":{"distance_ft":5,"must_see_attacker":true,"must_not_be_incapacitated":true,"effect":"disadvantage_on_any_ranged_attack"}}

Unseen attackers and targets
Lack of sight affects attacks, but does not automatically hide position.
Parameters: {"unseen_target":"disadvantage","unseen_attacker":"advantage","wrong_guessed_location":"automatic_miss","hidden_attack":"reveals_location_when_attack_hits_or_misses"}

Невидимые участники атаки
Отсутствие видимости влияет на атаки, но не скрывает позицию автоматически.
Параметры: {"unseen_target":"disadvantage","unseen_attacker":"advantage","wrong_guessed_location":"automatic_miss","hidden_attack":"reveals_location_when_attack_hits_or_misses"}

Attack action
Attack count depends on features; an attack is not the action.
Parameters: {"base_attacks":1,"extra_attack":"feature_specific","movement_between_attacks":true,"grapple_shove_may_replace_attack":true,"multiattack_is_separate_action":true}

Действие Атака
Число атак зависит от возможностей; отдельная атака не равна действию.
Параметры: {"base_attacks":1,"extra_attack":"feature_specific","movement_between_attacks":true,"grapple_shove_may_replace_attack":true,"multiattack_is_separate_action":true}

Opportunity attack
A visible hostile leaving reach can trigger a reaction.
Parameters: {"action_cost":"reaction","attack_count":1,"attack_kind":"melee","trigger":"visible_hostile_leaves_reach","timing":"immediately_before_leaving","exceptions":["disengage","teleport","movement_without_using_targets_movement_action_or_reaction"]}

Провоцированная атака
Выход видимого противника из досягаемости может вызвать реакцию.
Параметры: {"action_cost":"reaction","attack_count":1,"attack_kind":"melee","trigger":"visible_hostile_leaves_reach","timing":"immediately_before_leaving","exceptions":["disengage","teleport","movement_without_using_targets_movement_action_or_reaction"]}

Grapple
Grappling replaces an attack and uses a contest, not a save.
Parameters: {"action_cost":"one_attack_of_attack_action","free_hands_required":1,"max_target_size_difference":1,"range":"reach","attacker_check":"str:athletics","defender_choices":["str:athletics","dex:acrobatics"],"tie":"status_quo","incapacitated_target":"automatic_success","on_success":"grappled","release":"no_action"}

Захват
Захват заменяет атаку и разрешается состязанием, а не спасброском.
Параметры: {"action_cost":"one_attack_of_attack_action","free_hands_required":1,"max_target_size_difference":1,"range":"reach","attacker_check":"str:athletics","defender_choices":["str:athletics","dex:acrobatics"],"tie":"status_quo","incapacitated_target":"automatic_success","on_success":"grappled","release":"no_action"}

Escape a grapple
Escaping costs an action; a stat block may specify fixed difficulty.
Parameters: {"action_cost":"action","check_options":["str:athletics","dex:acrobatics"],"default_opposition":"grappler_str_athletics","monster_escape_dc":"use_explicit_stat_block_dc_when_present"}

Освобождение из захвата
Освобождение требует действия; стат-блок может задавать фиксированную сложность.
Параметры: {"action_cost":"action","check_options":["str:athletics","dex:acrobatics"],"default_opposition":"grappler_str_athletics","monster_escape_dc":"use_explicit_stat_block_dc_when_present"}

Shove
Shoving replaces an attack; success knocks prone or pushes away.
Parameters: {"action_cost":"one_attack_of_attack_action","max_target_size_difference":1,"range":"reach","attacker_check":"str:athletics","defender_choices":["str:athletics","dex:acrobatics"],"incapacitated_target":"automatic_success","success_options":[{"condition":"prone"},{"push_away_ft":5}]}

Толчок
Толчок заменяет атаку; успех сбивает с ног либо отодвигает.
Параметры: {"action_cost":"one_attack_of_attack_action","max_target_size_difference":1,"range":"reach","attacker_check":"str:athletics","defender_choices":["str:athletics","dex:acrobatics"],"incapacitated_target":"automatic_success","success_options":[{"condition":"prone"},{"push_away_ft":5}]}

Two-weapon fighting
The bonus attack requires eligible weapons and the Attack action.
Parameters: {"action_cost":"bonus_action","requires":["attack_action_with_light_melee_weapon","different_light_melee_weapon_in_other_hand"],"damage_ability_modifier":"add_only_if_negative_unless_feature_says_otherwise","thrown_permitted_when_weapon_has_thrown":true}

Бой двумя оружиями
Бонусная атака требует подходящих оружий и предшествующего действия Атака.
Параметры: {"action_cost":"bonus_action","requires":["attack_action_with_light_melee_weapon","different_light_melee_weapon_in_other_hand"],"damage_ability_modifier":"add_only_if_negative_unless_feature_says_otherwise","thrown_permitted_when_weapon_has_thrown":true}

Dash
Dashing adds movement, not another turn.
Parameters: {"action_cost":"action","extra_movement":"current_speed_after_modifiers"}

Рывок
Рывок добавляет перемещение, а не отдельный ход.
Параметры: {"action_cost":"action","extra_movement":"current_speed_after_modifiers"}

Disengage
Disengaging prevents movement-triggered opportunity attacks during the current turn.
Parameters: {"action_cost":"action","prevents":"opportunity_attacks_from_own_movement","until":"end_of_current_turn"}

Отход
Отход защищает перемещение от провоцированных атак в текущем ходу.
Параметры: {"action_cost":"action","prevents":"opportunity_attacks_from_own_movement","until":"end_of_current_turn"}

Dodge
Dodging hinders visible attackers and improves Dexterity saves.
Parameters: {"action_cost":"action","incoming_attacks":"disadvantage_if_defender_sees_attacker","dex_saves":"advantage","until":"start_of_next_own_turn","ends_if":["incapacitated","speed_0"]}

Уклонение
Уклонение затрудняет атаки видимых нападающих и улучшает спасброски Ловкости.
Параметры: {"action_cost":"action","incoming_attacks":"disadvantage_if_defender_sees_attacker","dex_saves":"advantage","until":"start_of_next_own_turn","ends_if":["incapacitated","speed_0"]}

Help in combat
Help supports a check or the first eligible allied attack.
Parameters: {"action_cost":"action","check_effect":"advantage_on_next_relevant_check","attack_effect":"advantage_on_first_attack_by_helped_ally_against_target","target_distance_from_helper_ft":5,"until":"start_of_helpers_next_turn"}

Помощь в бою
Помощь поддерживает проверку либо первую подходящую атаку союзника.
Параметры: {"action_cost":"action","check_effect":"advantage_on_next_relevant_check","attack_effect":"advantage_on_first_attack_by_helped_ally_against_target","target_distance_from_helper_ft":5,"until":"start_of_helpers_next_turn"}

Hide and stealth
Compare Stealth with Perception; there is no universal fixed difficulty.
Parameters: {"action_cost":"action","check":"dex:stealth","opposition":["passive_wis_perception","active_wis_perception"],"cannot_hide_when":"clearly_seen","noise_may_reveal_location":true,"dm_determines_hiding_possibility":true}

Засада и скрытность
Скрытность сопоставляется с Восприятием; единой фиксированной сложности нет.
Параметры: {"action_cost":"action","check":"dex:stealth","opposition":["passive_wis_perception","active_wis_perception"],"cannot_hide_when":"clearly_seen","noise_may_reveal_location":true,"dm_determines_hiding_possibility":true}

Ready an action
Ready specifies a perceivable trigger and uses a reaction afterward.
Parameters: {"action_cost":"action","response_cost":"reaction","response":["one_action","movement_up_to_speed"],"trigger":"perceivable_event","timing":"after_trigger_finishes","expires":"start_of_next_own_turn","trigger_may_be_ignored":true}

Подготовка действия
Подготовка задаёт воспринимаемый триггер и использует реакцию после него.
Параметры: {"action_cost":"action","response_cost":"reaction","response":["one_action","movement_up_to_speed"],"trigger":"perceivable_event","timing":"after_trigger_finishes","expires":"start_of_next_own_turn","trigger_may_be_ignored":true}

Ready a spell
Pay for the spell immediately and hold it with concentration.
Parameters: {"eligible_casting_time":"one_action","slot_spent":"when_readied","requires_concentration":true,"release_cost":"reaction","lost_without_effect_if":["concentration_ends","ready_expires"]}

Подготовка заклинания
Заклинание оплачивается заранее и удерживается концентрацией.
Параметры: {"eligible_casting_time":"one_action","slot_spent":"when_readied","requires_concentration":true,"release_cost":"reaction","lost_without_effect_if":["concentration_ends","ready_expires"]}

Objects on a turn
A free interaction does not replace specific magic item activation.
Parameters: {"free_simple_interactions":1,"second_simple_interaction_cost":"action","magic_item_activation":"follow_item_not_use_an_object","shield_don_doff_cost":"action"}

Предметы в свой ход
Свободное взаимодействие не заменяет специальную активацию магического предмета.
Параметры: {"free_simple_interactions":1,"second_simple_interaction_cost":"action","magic_item_activation":"follow_item_not_use_an_object","shield_don_doff_cost":"action"}

Knocking a creature out
A melee attack can leave a target unconscious but stable.
Parameters: {"requires":["melee_attack","reduces_target_to_0_hp"],"choice_timing":"when_damage_dealt","result":["unconscious","stable"]}

Несмертельный удар
Рукопашный удар может оставить цель без сознания, но стабильной.
Параметры: {"requires":["melee_attack","reduces_target_to_0_hp"],"choice_timing":"when_damage_dealt","result":["unconscious","stable"]}

Damage and resistance
Apply damage type and resistance conditions, not merely labels.
Parameters: {"minimum_damage":0,"resistance":"half_round_down","vulnerability":"double","immunity":"zero","same_type_resistances_stack":false,"same_type_vulnerabilities_stack":false,"order":["other_modifiers","resistance","vulnerability"],"conditional_resistances_require_predicate":true}

Урон и сопротивления
Учитывайте вид урона и условия сопротивления, а не только название.
Параметры: {"minimum_damage":0,"resistance":"half_round_down","vulnerability":"double","immunity":"zero","same_type_resistances_stack":false,"same_type_vulnerabilities_stack":false,"order":["other_modifiers","resistance","vulnerability"],"conditional_resistances_require_predicate":true}

Healing
Healing is capped by maximum hit points and does not itself resurrect.
Parameters: {"cap":"hit_point_maximum","dead_target":"cannot_heal_without_restoration_to_life","at_positive_hp":"end_unconsciousness_caused_by_0_hp"}

Восстановление хитов
Лечение ограничено максимумом хитов и не воскрешает само по себе.
Параметры: {"cap":"hit_point_maximum","dead_target":"cannot_heal_without_restoration_to_life","at_positive_hp":"end_unconsciousness_caused_by_0_hp"}

Temporary hit points
Temporary hit points absorb damage first and do not stack.
Parameters: {"new_pool":"choose_old_or_new","absorbed_before":"regular_hp","not_healed_by_normal_healing":true,"does_not_restore_consciousness":true,"default_expiry":"end_of_long_rest","does_not_stabilize":true}

Временные хиты
Временные хиты поглощают урон раньше обычных и не складываются.
Параметры: {"new_pool":"choose_old_or_new","absorbed_before":"regular_hp","not_healed_by_normal_healing":true,"does_not_restore_consciousness":true,"default_expiry":"end_of_long_rest","does_not_stabilize":true}

Dropping to zero hit points
Without instant death, fall unconscious; monsters may simply die.
Parameters: {"at_0_hp":"unconscious_until_healed","instant_death":"remaining_damage_after_reaching_0 >= hp_maximum","monster_default":"dm_may_rule_death_without_death_saves"}

Падение до нуля хитов
Без мгновенной смерти цель теряет сознание; правила чудовищ допускают смерть.
Параметры: {"at_0_hp":"unconscious_until_healed","instant_death":"remaining_damage_after_reaching_0 >= hp_maximum","monster_default":"dm_may_rule_death_without_death_saves"}

Death saving throws
Track successes and failures separately until stabilization or death.
Parameters: {"trigger":"start_of_own_turn_at_0_hp_not_stable","roll":"1d20","success_minimum":10,"natural_1_failures":2,"natural_20_heal_hp":1,"successes_to_stable":3,"failures_to_die":3,"ability_modifier":null,"reset_counters":["healed_above_0","becomes_stable"]}

Спасброски от смерти
Успехи и провалы учитываются раздельно до стабилизации или смерти.
Параметры: {"trigger":"start_of_own_turn_at_0_hp_not_stable","roll":"1d20","success_minimum":10,"natural_1_failures":2,"natural_20_heal_hp":1,"successes_to_stable":3,"failures_to_die":3,"ability_modifier":null,"reset_counters":["healed_above_0","becomes_stable"]}

Damage at zero hit points
Further damage harms a dying creature; critical hits are worse.
Parameters: {"damage_causes_failures":1,"critical_damage_causes_failures":2,"instant_death":"single_damage >= hp_maximum","stable_target":"ceases_to_be_stable"}

Урон при нуле хитов
Повторный урон ухудшает положение умирающего; критическое попадание опаснее.
Параметры: {"damage_causes_failures":1,"critical_damage_causes_failures":2,"instant_death":"single_damage >= hp_maximum","stable_target":"ceases_to_be_stable"}

Stabilizing
Medicine can stop death saves without restoring consciousness.
Parameters: {"action_cost":"action","check":"wis:medicine","dc":10,"stable_hp":0,"death_saves":false,"conscious":false,"recover_hp":1,"recovery_hours":"1d4","damage_ends_stability":true}

Стабилизация
Медицина может прекратить спасброски от смерти, не возвращая сознание.
Параметры: {"action_cost":"action","check":"wis:medicine","dc":10,"stable_hp":0,"death_saves":false,"conscious":false,"recover_hp":1,"recovery_hours":"1d4","damage_ends_stability":true}

Short rest
A short rest allows spending available Hit Dice.
Parameters: {"minimum_minutes":60,"activity":"nothing_more_strenuous_than_eating_drinking_reading_tending_wounds","healing_per_die":"max(0, hit_die_roll + con_modifier)","choose_each_die_separately":true,"hit_dice_recovered":0}

Короткий отдых
Во время короткого отдыха можно расходовать доступные Кости Хитов.
Параметры: {"minimum_minutes":60,"activity":"nothing_more_strenuous_than_eating_drinking_reading_tending_wounds","healing_per_die":"max(0, hit_die_roll + con_modifier)","choose_each_die_separately":true,"hit_dice_recovered":0}

Long rest
A long rest restores hit points and some Hit Dice.
Parameters: {"minimum_hours":8,"sleep_hours":6,"maximum_light_activity_hours":2,"regain_hp":"all_missing","hit_dice_recovery":"max(1, floor(total_hit_dice / 2))","hit_dice_cap":"total_hit_dice","benefit_at_most_once_per_hours":24,"minimum_start_hp":1,"interruption":"at_least_1_hour_walking_fighting_casting_or_similar_adventuring_requires_restart","racial_exceptions":"apply_explicit_2014_feature"}

